cyclables.\n\nCette situation privilégiée, à 10 min de Rennes, permet de profiter du calme des lieux et du plaisir de tout faire à pied au coeur d'un bourg animé.\n\nDans un environnement verdoyant, \"Le Clos de Saint-Avit\" propose 23 logements prolongés d'un jardin, d'un balcon ou d'une terrasse.","addr":"Rue de l'Echange - ZAC du Centre aux Mares Noires","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijk2YzJiMDU0ZjJiZjY0ZmQyZDRkMzRiZjE5ZWE5YmNhODc3YWI5NGEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhM2JkNTAwYmFlNWUwMTEyMDc0MjEyYzQxOTdiZTQ0MiJ9?signature=0574b4b9261bdf4b343e4efe99087b544c25076ee716d651297f2085db023d4e","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImM1NmI3NTQ0OTc1MzhmNTIyNGYzZGYxOTMzMzVhZTk1ZWExYWU2NmMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhYTVlNTI5OTM3ZmFkMDU4MjlmMjA2NTVlOTNhY2ZhMiJ9?signature=b97154e3d807db6abc6f6a9a8561d6065233ab4ccdfb611abde43bda4c4110a3","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImQxNGQyMjgyNDllMDFjMDcxZTI0ZDk5Y2RlMzExOWQ3ODc2YTU1NTMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJlMmQyMDA0MGRhYjhhYTVmYmI4ZTM4ZmJhZGE5YjFiZCJ9?signature=a1e7e59553a7e1894262ba79a0c31c03c3d87be0511e584a3c71fec5cb5b2a37","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.?signature=db72144ac333d1d62c1695f59e4a1bca516aba3a846f5254899b578aa36c1383","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.?signature=5f774bb6e536944c39066aee5cc5f5159543a2de33af3b22c9d8602ffb122164","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.?signature=f367cf0b21307343dd0ecdbb82cd5a580ff424cf45a6e69eebc82fe8c94a560f","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.?signature=988bcac37d56951d5a88570932931e0d0ab97b4141ece0d406c4fb23270bdf3f","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi